{"4669560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Factory Simulator", "steam_appid": 4669560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your country has been attacked and the military needs the support of the best engineers in the country and turns to you for help. You launch your startup and begin designing and manufacturing <strong>UAV drones</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design, build, improve and test UAV drones</strong>. Use <strong>3D printers, CNC lasers, lathes and milling machines</strong> to build increasingly better structures. Complete missions, destroy ground and naval targets, expand your business and hire employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Drone Factory Simulator, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >operate the Drone Designer program, which allows you to design the best possible drones for specific missions,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >operate the machines that produce drone components,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >assemble drones and install equipment and explosives,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >test drones in the field,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use the Ground Control Station to plan routes and complete missions,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >earn money and expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and craft fuselages and wings, assemble engines, batteries, cameras and explosive warheads to complete the most challenging missions in a variety of conditions. Produce components from the best and most durable materials while maintaining a low drone production cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic drone construction simulation with immersive missions and fantastic explosions. Save your country from invasion by destroying enemy targets and become the owner of a huge and prosperous enterprise.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your country has been attacked and the military needs the support of the best engineers in the country and turns to you for help. You launch your startup and begin designing and manufacturing <strong>UAV drones</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design, build, improve and test UAV drones</strong>. Use <strong>3D printers, CNC lasers, lathes and milling machines</strong> to build increasingly better structures. Complete missions, destroy ground and naval targets, expand your business and hire employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Drone Factory Simulator, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >operate the Drone Designer program, which allows you to design the best possible drones for specific missions,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >operate the machines that produce drone components,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >assemble drones and install equipment and explosives,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >test drones in the field,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use the Ground Control Station to plan routes and complete missions,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >earn money and expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select and craft fuselages and wings, assemble engines, batteries, cameras and explosive warheads to complete the most challenging missions in a variety of conditions. Produce components from the best and most durable materials while maintaining a low drone production cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic drone construction simulation with immersive missions and fantastic explosions. Save your country from invasion by destroying enemy targets and become the owner of a huge and prosperous enterprise.</p>", "short_description": "Your country has been attacked and the military turns to your startup for help. Design and build UAV drones to strike enemy targets. Develop new technologies, buy production equipment, improve your drone designs and hire the people to turn a small company into a major force in the drone industry.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669560/a3f5bafd5404bdebb86d8a96dcf5968370778871/header.jpg?t=1787036741", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669560/97a7544bbeae63da2761877ecc7c9c17882b61b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787036741", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4669560/97a7544bbeae63da2761877ecc7c9c17882b61b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787036741", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3550 / AMD Ryzen 3 3xxx<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon R9 270X (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 / AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</